==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Keese Eyeballs are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by all types of [[Keese]] upon their defeat. Like other [[Monster Part]]s, they can be used as an ingredient to make [[Elixir]]s. However, they can also be used to make [[Orange Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] or exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]].

The [[Soldier's Set]] requires Keese Eyeballs to upgrade each piece to its second level at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
{{Material Armors|BotW|Keese Eyeball}}

